{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_218e15edcc6f415087bcabd838011b9a0955da30cd668baed3cf0d9a3d2c1314","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4c049d7b40462de97526064fede944da108e388f77ad6b330a20062e24eac677","slc_6ce558b60b23138a1c7e78e81d08b3d6fafe028bfd47b6179462eec0a919149f","slc_b0e74a08a9d09bef0a0934970a5fd5a86f1af11c4a160fd14dd8441ac0e70fbb","slc_b1c30b2a59e59d9a2cdcd788618390d9b31e5ed419e36d51814dc4f7165ef7e9","slc_c9fc89c35f7ec7da0ad4d5212959b2bd83ae419fd2e47d3f5b10f504a763d215"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"State lives in ~/.tokentelemetry/ as hand-editable JSON files (aliases, hidden projects, preferences, billing, power, VERSION), with no database; a data directory can be relocated via --data-dir or TOKENTELEMETRY_DATA_DIR.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3b105f84ba2154e987ae0ed3ec93550f58bb04873265bde7e0d18ddc587a405a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_26d4c3e963620ffbfe0b669c047689d8ca78b2886dc9e5dd2126decf804b7712","slc_e06a3779864c25a479ea374802f426b385f86694effe7a5af9cb62527b4932a6","slc_ff7eb10e75b339bd8a128e085ede1c5f593a47cc11e7351d06c7474214b2c1b8"],"source_ids":["src_8b22c0c487725df3a006c5c586923d12"],"text":"Per ADR-0002, a durable local SQLite store at ~/.tokentelemetry/history.db is upserted on every background scan, storing raw facts so analytics history survives agents pruning their transcripts; derived insights are recomputed at read time.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3c84438fa8653291dd4085852d5af5781d91abd671ab05ea36bf1d7d75e9fd45","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_42c85fe82749fbed70978856290bb0f527ec046bff37130094cb0b1363fd56d0","slc_9f02c263353b97605dfc297580a2465b92b0fa91f11bffd3d08b69c821c9bcc2"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"Requirements are Node.js 20.9+, Python 3.9+, git, and at least one supported AI coding agent already installed; a badge also mentions Node 18+.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_68b0c3e344fb183685739c8b58069a1b5973ce0fa73c6093178fe77ab591ccad","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_20c6a29eab1b62fda786d285ec3b7a95c8ad9c84d628972ce6e86ef791891bd3","slc_630806bd2d2d9be2de3c5a251cd28dec5915f9a50771e39498a434f2d8308316"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"TokenTelemetry is a free, open-source, 100% local observability dashboard tracking token usage, LLM costs, tool calls, session traces, and reasoning steps across AI coding agents, with no signup or cloud.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_706ef55e52cf12d2ef5cd096912a5e44098a56dc70a633f84ca5b821ec6acb6d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6d14228b11e9c665bd2138ab242bb517195aaa84a2abaee20f16bc89f9207a1b","slc_f0d66a26035362ff016692dde164b391968e61889d3839971bb59a036728f1f7"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"Remote access is opt-in: --host 0.0.0.0 exposes the backend, a random auth token is auto-generated and printed once unless --auth-token or --insecure-no-auth is passed, and loopback clients never need the token.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_79be6ddfaadeee675fdc7effff93b4c9724d3f6ff99ae5110747602707c579b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_198e09d677fce0c267642b9ce070ce5622c903cedd7e5206d74d5aec693ef1ec","slc_463d23c05513816de698fcb4a48815ce36df19271cafafd424b4505df3f8f25f","slc_7f99008875879268a6c9874c047ff91d4ea40aff19305170245c92aa6949ed76","slc_f5bac617d9514a487993b7798bf288cf4335dea6cfb26d5fd42bba18462e9f21"],"source_ids":["src_246d59de8e7251638564cf2e9a372572","src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions follow a branch-and-PR flow (feat/ branches, conventional commit messages), and ADR-0001 requires an architecture decision record in docs/adr/ committed in the same PR as the code it describes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7be3102974ebd2a6598b9688012b82c1920d734b3286e4faa6b6716455833b9c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ccc0a2e33ea82851c8838a7d0a02073d3448f7e5e7faa5249e7250b85245f914","slc_d98e7beb9ca25fbd22b98292fda58d8373ecc89c52794c53d523e24ea2507dea"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"The Hermes dashboard plugin embeds TokenTelemetry as a tab inside Hermes's own web dashboard (port 9119 to 3000), is pure-frontend with no extra backend, and deep-links to Analytics, Projects, and All Agents pages.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a8151abc510ddd17b79baa7ea2860d8d31873c749d4b43250849136ef534d861","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cc7de5ba34935080af1148c845d5b2602c874ccb7514667b1bda80366d8d9b02","slc_ce15f6b2b1d83c4ab78ec7b3ecfce513f3a6c4d55f7db62f8ed4113e6469f94f"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"Budgets are observational by design: TokenTelemetry tracks spend against user-set limits and alerts at 80% and 100% thresholds but never blocks an agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b15ac39f424c74f9b3055310193167d06eca8b31ec65ff4491727c394c505e3f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_22a923ed9fc2a7824df57842da5ce61438867691cb357b58ab668da0f57752bf","slc_33707872142d81793de76475e40f65fd2d0553e65a92fb771d87e9a5c340b1eb","slc_d917ed27efdddd34d08bfd5acb49cc10612b57e6efe974136e82a1166b71dfbc"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"Plan-limit readings come from the provider's own login data on the machine rather than being estimated from history, and the UI distinguishes provider plan ceilings from user-defined project budgets.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cacefcb6fb54ab215d891f43c7fe0c78c075932c9f93bde9483b81405aa9feab","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_561d4e0709313a7134c5b2e26cc545366cd56b2dd22d0c96757c5859ffa004db","slc_ad185116aa513c394732f6891fcfed65662bfc0c0c1c545dfdc2fd605bd98005"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"Hermes support reads $HERMES_HOME (or ~/.hermes/) locally on the same host, with no remote-DB mode yet; Qoder support tracks credits rather than tokens because Qoder records none.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dcc2a07f58084c5a5c433d81272c1e7f82aeb1eb378c76093cf4fcad683a8d10","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a5f34b77b00c42d55f7aea698f385e49b9453f786b861932011e7092a3e587ad"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"The project structure includes a Python FastAPI backend that reads agent logs and serves a REST API, a Next.js 16 React frontend dashboard, a cross-platform bin/cli.js launcher, and install.sh/install.ps1 installers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e21e58a6811eb912023a3110359ae1675479d67c3a55ac9a7443bc11a165363a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e06a3779864c25a479ea374802f426b385f86694effe7a5af9cb62527b4932a6"],"source_ids":["src_8b22c0c487725df3a006c5c586923d12"],"text":"Per ADR-0002, history capture starts from the first run (already-pruned transcripts are unrecoverable), pruned sessions without archival show only in aggregates, and transcript archival currently resolves single-file transcripts only for claude/codex.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e3c30333f6ca868772cfa0db363aaac78e0d381ec03ab945876b97ff9e878de2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"vasihemanth/tokentelemetry@0d691ae343ed snapshot 584cdc952070dd60","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_978c246155a884dcf5cdf5ec660a96d456b4b3345ae7f93e8eb59f0ba82a770e","slc_d1d5bfb5c72ac17d323e6d5b6aa4b0b0b58073729d5b7b2fac9fee768a2f805e"],"source_ids":["src_c248bbe947875788b7c371ab20358dfa"],"text":"Unlike Langfuse, LangSmith, or Helicone, TokenTelemetry requires no code instrumentation, account, SDK, or API key — it works by reading the log files agents already write, fully locally.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
